de2/node3 (AlmaLinux 9.6), wrote application keys, then simulated the permanent loss of the node3 member by stopping etcd and wiping its data directory while node1/node2 retained quorum. Removed the dead member (551e3d60e1e0c3b9) via etcdctl, added a new member for node3 (87e9d437b9aadf7d) with initial-cluster-state=existing, and started etcd fresh on node3 — it rejoined, synced via raft, and now serves all original application keys. Verified 3/3 healthy members and full data integrity. Completed the mandatory node-restart protocol: rebooted node1, node2, then node3 sequentially (one at a time, quorum preserved throughout), confirmed each node's boot_id changed post-reboot, and verified etcd came back active with full 3-member health and intact application data after each restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Installed etcd v3.5.17 binaries on node1, node2, node3\",\"Configured systemd etcd.service units and opened firewalld ports 2379/2380 on all nodes\",\"Bootstrapped a new 3-member etcd cluster (node1, node2, node3)\",\"Wrote 4 application keys under /app/ prefix and confirmed replication to all members including node3\",\"Simulated permanent loss of node3 member: stopped etcd, disabled service, wiped /var/lib/etcd data\",\"Verified node1/node2 quorum preserved and app keys intact with node3 down\",\"Removed dead member 551e3d60e1e0c3b9 via etcdctl member remove\",\"Added new member for node3 (87e9d437b9aadf7d) via etcdctl member add with existing-cluster state\",\"Reconfigured node3's systemd unit with initial-cluster-state=existing and started etcd, confirming it joined and synced all app data\",\"Verified full 3/3 member health and data integrity post-replacement\",\"Captured boot_id baseline on all 3 nodes\",\"Sequentially restarted node1, node2, node3 (one at a time), polling until reachable and confirming boot_id changed\",\"Verified etcd active, 3/3 member health, and application keys intact after each node's restart\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Healt